datasets from:
https://www.nist.gov/itl/products-and-services/emnist-dataset

extract the matlab.zip and place its contents in ./emnist/
and then run `make all`
I can't put the datasets here because they are too large for github

also set your terminal background colour include/config.h
for viewing the images

the image format that the actual C program will use is as follows:

byte 0: label (ASCII character code, NOT an integer (because letters)
bytes [1, 7]: pad
u64: height of image (Little-Endian)
u64: width of image (Little-Endian)
remaining width * height bytes, greyscale value out of 255, row-major order
